Aim: Find the largest element in an array.

Algorithm: Start; assume first element is largest; compare remaining elements; print largest; stop.

Program:

class LargestArray {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] a = {12, 45, 7, 31, 19};
        int max = a[0];
        for (int i=1; i<a.length; i++)
            if (a[i] > max) max = a[i];
        System.out.println("Largest = " + max);
    }
}

Result: Largest = 45

